{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"c71c20f4d63a28829bad75e93ad858a322dc4ffcbe1d504342fa88f19253826f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["持守真道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["因此，我們必須更加重視所聽的道，以免隨流漂去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["既然藉天使傳下來的話確鑿無誤，凡干犯、違背的人都受到了應有的報應，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們若忽略這麼大的救恩，怎能逃避懲罰呢？這救恩首先由主親口宣講出來，後來由聽見的人向我們證實了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["同時，上帝按自己的旨意，用神蹟、奇事、各樣的異能和聖靈的恩賜與他們一同作見證。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["救恩的元帥"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝並沒有把我們所談論的未來世界交給天使掌管。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["相反，有人在聖經中作見證說：",{"text":"「人算什麼，你竟顧念他？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人算什麼，你竟眷顧他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使他暫時比天使低微一點，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜他榮耀和尊貴作冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派他管理你所造的萬物，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使萬物降服在他腳下。」","poem":1},{"noteId":7},"既然說了叫萬物都降服在人的管理之下，就沒有一樣例外。不過，我們到現在還沒有看到萬物都降服在人的管理之下，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["只看見耶穌暫時比天使低微一點，好靠著上帝的恩典為世人親嘗死亡的滋味。祂因為經歷死亡的痛苦而得到了尊貴和榮耀作冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["作為萬物的歸宿和本源的上帝，叫救恩的元帥耶穌經歷苦難而得以純全，以便帶領許多的兒女進入榮耀，這樣的安排是恰當的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為使人聖潔的耶穌和那些得以聖潔的人都出自同一位父親，所以耶穌不以稱呼他們弟兄姊妹為恥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祂說：",{"text":"「我要向眾弟兄傳揚你的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在會眾當中歌頌你。」","poem":1},{"noteId":8}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又說：",{"text":"「我要倚靠祂。」","poem":1},{"noteId":9},"還說：",{"text":"「看啊，我和上帝賜給我的兒女都在這裡。」","poem":1},{"noteId":10}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因為眾兒女都是血肉之軀，所以祂也同樣成為血肉之軀，以便親身經歷死亡，藉此摧毀掌握死亡權勢的魔鬼，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["釋放那些因怕死而一生做奴隸的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["很明顯，祂要救助的不是天使，而是亞伯拉罕的後裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以祂必須在每一方面都與祂的弟兄姊妹相同，以便在事奉上帝的事上成為一位仁慈忠信的大祭司，替眾人獻上贖罪祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["祂經歷過受試探的痛苦，所以能幫助受試探的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇8·4‑6。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇22·22。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":12}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書8·17。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"以賽亞書8·18。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}